  "_comment": [
    "Bundled third-party executables, pinned by sha256. The binaries are not",
    "committed - scripts/fetch-binaries.mjs downloads them into",
    "resources/bin/<platform>-<arch>/ at install and build time, and refuses",
    "anything whose digest does not match.",
    "",
    "ffmpeg is a GPL build (it needs libx264 for the H.264 export), which is",
    "compatible with this project's GPL-3.0-or-later. Redistributing it",
    "carries the usual obligation to offer corresponding source: see",
    "sourceUrl below and the entry in CREDITS.md.",
    "",
    "Nothing else in the app depends on ffmpeg. Import, repair, join and",
    "playback are all pure TypeScript, so a missing or broken ffmpeg costs",
    "only the optional MP4 export."
